&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re the world&#39;s leading consumer healthcare platform, supporting millions of patients across the US, Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan, Spain and Canada.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re driven by the belief that good health should last a lifetime, and that to get there we need to deliver the personalised, high quality and empathetic care that the traditional system cannot support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with our care teams of prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists and dietitians to support patients across preventative health, weight management and specific women&#39;s and men&#39;s health conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We joined Hims &amp;amp; Hers so that you can do all of the above on a bigger scale, with more ambition, a stronger global brand and the resources to deliver care to patients in dozens of countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who appreciate and are excited by the enormity and uniqueness of this challenge, and want to work in the most ambitious, smart, fast moving and positive sum environment of their lives to transform how healthcare is delivered globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope that&#39;s you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a talented Senior Product Designer with a passion for health and excitement about building our expanding healthcare platform. You enjoy working in dynamic environments, solving complex problems, and creating thoughtful, user-centred design solutions that make a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
